# Auth is via Google Application Default Credentials, not an API key here --
# pi-agent-gemini's org policy blocks plain Gemini-Developer-API keys.
# Run once: gcloud auth application-default login
#
# These two are optional overrides (defaults are already pi-agent-gemini /
# us-central1 in config.py):
# GEMINI_PROJECT=pi-agent-gemini
# GEMINI_LOCATION=us-central1
